From 642cde75fa10757d5fcc3fd2a83b034a27a6e891 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 05:33:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(kanban): record why pickup skips a pinned card and open
 repair work when it stalls [daveey]

A ready card pinned runs_on=[machine:<host>] that the host never imported raised no
alert and left no evidence of why (t_01a1c81a5323b6d1 waited 23 min on the hub,
2026-11-11; cause undetermined, t_01a1c9097f6a94bc).

Evidence: pickup() now records, for every candidate pinned to this machine that a
pass does not import, the reason (budget_exhausted, profile_ineligible,
capability_missing, parents_incomplete, hold, other) with first/last time and a pass
count, one row per (card, reason) in the machine-local kanban_pickup_skips table
(refreshed at most every 60 s unless the reason changes; pruned after 7 d, capped
at 2000 rows). A tick with no spawn slot, where pickup never ran, records why
through the new worker_pickup_capped seam. budget_exhausted is recorded only for
cards a slot would start, so a refusal is never hidden behind a full queue.
kanban_show of the replica card returns pickup_skip; `hermes kanban show` names it
on not-found.

Detector (kanban_pickup_stall.sweep, every non-dry tick before the spawn cap via
the parent-unclaimed sweep): a card ready in the full replica, pinned to this
machine, created elsewhere, unleased, not imported, ready longer than
kanban.sync.pickup_stall_seconds (default 600) gets ONE agent repair card on this
host carrying the last skip reason; an open one, or one closed under an hour ago,
is reused. Host-wide causes (budget_exhausted, a registry hold, an unreadable
registry) share ONE per-host card naming the oldest, at priority -1 so it never
takes the slot the cards wait for; none while dispatch is paused (a drain writes
no fresh evidence). No Inbox post, no human_request.

Proof: tests/hermes_cli/test_kanban_pickup_stall.py (27). RED before the fix: the
601 s case files 0 repair cards (ValueError: expected 1, got 0). Neighbouring
suites (68 files, 1050 tests) green. Mutants on the live-import check, capped
reason split, open-repair filter and record dedupe each fail a test.
